{"2942520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rastignac: Wastelands", "steam_appid": 2942520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rastignac Wastelands</strong> is a single-player extraction shooter set in a hostile procedural open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run sends you into a dangerous zone where your goal is simple:<br><strong>loot valuable resources and make it out alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But staying longer means more loot — and more danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISK / REWARD LOOP</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the zone with limited equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hostile environments and scavenge resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable threats and escalating danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide when to extract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fail to extract, and you lose everything you carried</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every second increases the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Extraction-based gameplay</strong> — loot resources and decide when to leave</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>High risk / high reward runs</strong> — push further or play it safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Procedural open world</strong> — every run is different</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Meaningful loss</strong> — fail to extract and lose your loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Hardcore single-player experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔️ <strong>Atmospheric, minimalist presentation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now. Risk it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.poster.avif?t=1770506811\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.webm?t=1770506811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/82841807f91aa834206ce7b46f860353.mp4?t=1770506811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons and tools to fend off enemies and scavenge for supplies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fbd110f342e428eb175d4203bf213ec4.poster.avif?t=1770506811\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fbd110f342e428eb175d4203bf213ec4.webm?t=1770506811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/fbd110f342e428eb175d4203bf213ec4.mp4?t=1770506811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/ab87b39744d59e6afce89943f015c02e.poster.avif?t=1770506811\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942520/extras/ab87b39744d59e6afce89943f015c02e.webm?t=1770506811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com